{"id":"662800","name":"酸菜炖排骨","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/662800/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"排骨","amount":"适量"},{"name":"东北酸菜","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"葱花","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"生姜洗净切片。","img":"images/662800/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"排骨冷水下锅焯烫出血水后洗净备用。","img":"images/662800/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"酸菜清水洗净备用。","img":"images/662800/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"排骨放入珐琅锅里。","img":"images/662800/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"加入适量清水。","img":"images/662800/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"大火煮开转小火45分钟左右。","img":"images/662800/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"锅中热油放入酸菜。","img":"images/662800/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"大火翻炒炒干水份。","img":"images/662800/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"分钟后排骨已经炖的很软烂了。","img":"images/662800/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"放入炒过的酸菜。","img":"images/662800/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"盖上继续中小火15-20分钟左右即可。","img":"images/662800/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"出锅前试下咸淡后再调味。","img":"images/662800/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/662800/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/662800/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/662800/step_15.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅、炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}